(8) Tj T*
(Figure 1: From Autocomplete to Autonomy) Tj T*
(The implications for the software development life cycle \(SDLC\) are profound. Every phase) Tj T*
(- from requirements gathering to deployment to maintenance - is being reshaped by AI) Tj T*
(capabilities. But this transformation isn't uniform or simple. The spectrum ranges from casual) Tj T*
("vibe coding," where a developer prompts an AI and accepts whatever comes back, to) Tj T*
(disciplined "agentic engineering," where AI acts as a powerful implementation engine within) Tj T*
(carefully designed systems of constraints, tests, and feedback loops, with humans retaining) Tj T*
(oversight over architecture, correctness, and quality.) Tj T*
(The distinction matters. Telling a CTO that your team is vibe coding their payment processing) Tj T*
(system will, and should, raise alarm bells. Telling that same CTO that your team practices) Tj T*
(agentic engineering, with AI handling implementation under human-designed constraints) Tj T*
(while test coverage ensures correctness, is a fundamentally different conversation.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
