(10) Tj T*
(The shift from syntax to intent) Tj T*
(Before we go further, we need a shared picture of what an agent is and what vibe coding) Tj T*
(actually means. Both terms have accumulated enough meanings that they need to be) Tj T*
(unpacked carefully.) Tj T*
(AI Agents: A Quick Refresher) Tj T*
(An AI agent is a software system that perceives a goal, plans steps to reach it, takes actions) Tj T*
(through tools, observes the results, and iterates until the goal is met or it hits a stopping) Tj T*
(condition. Where a chatbot produces a response and waits for the next prompt, an agent) Tj T*
(runs its own loop. You give it a goal at the top, then it decides what to do next at each step.) Tj T*
(Figure 2: The Agent Loop - Perceive, plan, act, observe, iterate.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
