(14) Tj T*
(Figure 3: The Vibe Coding to Agentic Engineering Spectrum) Tj T*
(The single biggest differentiator between the two ends is how outputs get verified. In vibe) Tj T*
(coding, verification is optional; the developer runs the code and checks if it seems right. In) Tj T*
(agentic engineering, two mechanisms work together. Tests verify the deterministic parts of) Tj T*
(the system: a function given this input produces that output. Evaluations, or evals, verify the) Tj T*
(Applied Tip:) Tj T*
(The right position on this spectrum depends on the stakes. A weekend prototype) Tj T*
(can be pure vibe coding. A production API handling financial transactions demands) Tj T*
(agentic engineering. Most real work falls somewhere in between, and the skill is) Tj T*
(knowing where to draw the line for each task.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
