(Page 17 of 51 - 02 - The New SDLC  With Vibe Coding) Tj T*
(The new SDLC with vibe coding) Tj T*
(May 2026) Tj T*
(17) Tj T*
(Figure 4: Context Engineering -- Static vs. Dynamic) Tj T*
(The most powerful pattern for managing dynamic context is Agent Skills: structured,) Tj T*
(portable packages of procedural knowledge that the agent loads only when the task calls for) Tj T*
(it.) Tj T*
(Rather than embedding every piece of specialized knowledge into the agent's system) Tj T*
(prompt, skills allow the agent to remain a lightweight generalist that flexes into specialist) Tj T*
(roles on demand through progressive disclosure. The agent sees only lightweight metadata) Tj T*
(at startup, loads full instructions when a task matches, and pulls deep reference material) Tj T*
(only when explicitly needed. The result is that an agent can carry dozens of specialized) Tj T*
(capabilities while paying the token cost for only the one it is actively using.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
