(A note on pace of change: The phase-by-phase picture described above reflects the state) Tj T*
(of AI-driven SDLC  as of mid-2026. It is shifting fast. Early signs suggest that the compression) Tj T*
(will spread beyond implementation: teams are already experimenting with workflows where) Tj T*
(developers go directly from specs to review, with AI agents handling implementation, testing,) Tj T*
