(The new SDLC with vibe coding) Tj T*
(May 2026) Tj T*
(25) Tj T*
(A factory manager does not assemble every widget by hand. They design the assembly line) Tj T*
(and ensure quality control. The modern developer designs the development system and) Tj T*
(ensures that its output meets the required standard. Success comes from giving agents) Tj T*
(success criteria rather than step-by-step instructions, then letting them iterate.) Tj T*
(Figure 6: The Factory Model Developer designs the system -> agents produce the code -> tests verify) Tj T*
(the output.) Tj T*
(This raises the question that drives the rest of this paper: what is the central machine in) Tj T*
(the factory? What does the agent itself, the thing doing the work inside the assembly line,) Tj T*
(actually look like?) Tj T*
ET
