(May 2026) Tj T*
(26) Tj T*
(If the developer is the factory manager, the AI model is merely the raw engine on the factory) Tj T*
(floor. An engine on its own cannot manufacture a car; it needs belts, gears, safety sensors,) Tj T*
(and an assembly line. In the context of AI-assisted development, this surrounding machinery) Tj T*
(is known as the Harness.) Tj T*
(Harness Engineering: What surrounds) Tj T*
(the model) Tj T*
(There is a temptation, when builders start working with AI agents, to treat the model as the) Tj T*
(system. A new model comes out, the agent gets smarter. An older model and the agent gets) Tj T*
(worse. The model becomes the explanation for everything good and bad.) Tj T*
(That intuition is wrong, and it leads to the wrong investments. The model is one input into a) Tj T*
(running agent. Everything else, the prompts, the tools, the context policies, the hooks, the) Tj T*
(sandboxes, the sub-agents, the observability, is the harness: the scaffolding wrapped around) Tj T*
(the model that lets it actually finish something.¹¹) Tj T*
(A useful equation:) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
