(May 2026) Tj T*
(27) Tj T*
(A raw model is not an agent. It becomes one once a harness gives it state, tool execution,) Tj T*
(feedback loops, and enforceable constraints. The behaviour developers experience when) Tj T*
(working with Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, Antigravity, Aider, or Cline is dominated by what) Tj T*
(the harness does, not just by which model is underneath.) Tj T*
(Figure 7: Harness Anatomy | Agent = Model + Harness) Tj T*
ET
