(The new SDLC with vibe coding) Tj T*
(May 2026) Tj T*
(29) Tj T*
(Harness in SDLC) Tj T*
(While the model itself determines how to accomplish a task, the harness is the scaffolding) Tj T*
(that provides access to the tools, sandboxes, and orchestration needed to execute it.) Tj T*
(Therefore, this harness must be present in every phase where an AI agent operates.) Tj T*
(Here is how the harness actively operates across the different phases of the new SDLC:) Tj T*
(1. Requirements, Planning, & Architecture \(Configuring) Tj T*
(the Harness\)) Tj T*
(This is where the harness is configured and calibrated. Before the AI writes any production) Tj T*
(code, the developer must set up the agent's environment.) Tj T*
(* Harness Configuration: Providing the Instructions and Rule Files \(e.g., creating the) Tj T*
(AGENTS.md and defining architectural constraints\) that the harness will load and make) Tj T*
(available to the model.) Tj T*
(* The Action: The developer defines the tools the agent will have access to \(like specific) Tj T*
(APIs or database schemas\) and sets the fundamental rules the agent cannot break.) Tj T*
(2. Implementation \(Running the Harness\)) Tj T*
(During active coding, the harness acts as the boundary that keeps the AI model focused,) Tj T*
(secure, and productive.) Tj T*
(* Harness Components Used: Sandboxes, Execution Environments, and Tools.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
