(Page 30 of 51 - 02 - The New SDLC  With Vibe Coding) Tj T*
(The new SDLC with vibe coding) Tj T*
(May 2026) Tj T*
(30) Tj T*
(* The Action: As the model generates code, it executes it within the harness's isolated) Tj T*
(sandbox. If the model needs to read a file or search the web, it uses the tools provided) Tj T*
(by the harness.) Tj T*
(3. Testing & QA \(The Feedback Loop\)) Tj T*
(Testing in an agentic workflow relies heavily on the harness to facilitate) Tj T*
(autonomous self-correction.) Tj T*
(* Harness Components Used: Orchestration Logic and Guardrails.) Tj T*
(* The Action: When the agent writes a function, the harness provides the execution) Tj T*
(environment \(such as a sandboxed terminal\) that allows the automated tests to be) Tj T*
(executed. If a test fails, the orchestration logic captures the error output from that) Tj T*
(environment and routes it back to the model, asking it to try again. The harness is what) Tj T*
(creates this automated 'think -> act -> observe' loop.") Tj T*
(4. Code Review, Deployment, & Maintenance \(Observing) Tj T*
(the Harness\)) Tj T*
(Even after the code is written, the harness ensures the agent behaves safely in live or) Tj T*
(near-live environments.) Tj T*
(* Harness Components Used: Hooks and Observability.) Tj T*
(* The Action: The harness runs deterministic hooks \(e.g., blocking a commit if the agent) Tj T*
(tries to push a hard-coded password\). Furthermore, the observability layer tracks token) Tj T*
(costs, latency, and agent drift, allowing human engineers to audit exactly why an agent) Tj T*
(made a specific deployment decision.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
