(Page 32 of 51 - 02 - The New SDLC  With Vibe Coding) Tj T*
(The new SDLC with vibe coding) Tj T*
(May 2026) Tj T*
(32) Tj T*
(Figure 8: Conductor vs. Orchestrator \(Two modes of working with AI Agents\)) Tj T*
(The conductor: hands-on, real-time direction) Tj T*
(In conductor mode, a developer works in real-time with an AI pair-programmer. They're in) Tj T*
(the IDE, watching code appear, guiding the AI with prompts and corrections, and maintaining) Tj T*
(fine-grained control over what gets written. The AI is a powerful instrument, but the) Tj T*
(developer is actively directing every movement.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
