stream
BT
/F1 10 Tf
36 756 Td
13 TL
(Page 33 of 51 - 02 - The New SDLC  With Vibe Coding) Tj T*
(The new SDLC with vibe coding) Tj T*
(May 2026) Tj T*
(33) Tj T*
(This mode is typical when working on complex logic, debugging tricky issues, or working in) Tj T*
(unfamiliar codebases where the developer needs to understand each change as it's made.) Tj T*
(Tools like GitHub Copilot, Google's Gemini Code Assist, Cursor, and Windsurf primarily) Tj T*
(support this mode through inline completions, chat interfaces, and edit-in-place capabilities.) Tj T*
(The conductor mode is natural for developers who come from traditional engineering) Tj T*
(backgrounds. It preserves the sense of understanding and control that many engineers value.) Tj T*
(The risk is that it can also become a bottleneck - if the developer is personally directing every) Tj T*
(keystroke, the throughput improvement from AI is limited.) Tj T*
(The orchestrator: async, multi-agent delegation) Tj T*
(In orchestrator mode, the developer operates at a higher level of abstraction. They) Tj T*
(define goals, assign them to agents, and review results - but they're not watching code) Tj T*
(appear line by line. Agents may be working in the background, in parallel, on different) Tj T*
(parts of a codebase. The developer checks in periodically, reviews output, and provides) Tj T*
(course corrections.) Tj T*
(This mode is typical for well-defined tasks like bug fixes, feature implementations against) Tj T*
(established patterns, codebase migrations, and test generation. Tools like Google's Jules,) Tj T*
(GitHub Copilot's agent mode, Cursor's background agents, and Claude Code support this) Tj T*
(mode through async task execution, often working in sandboxed environments with full) Tj T*
(access to the repository, build tools, and test suites.13) Tj T*
(The orchestrator mode requires a different skill set. Instead of deep expertise in syntax and) Tj T*
(language idioms, it demands strong skills in:) Tj T*
(* Specification: Defining tasks precisely enough that an agent can execute them) Tj T*
(without ambiguity) Tj T*
ET
endstream
