(The Economics of AI Development) Tj T*
(When evaluating the impact of AI on the software development life cycle, the conversation) Tj T*
(often begins and ends with developer velocity: how fast can we write code? However, for) Tj T*
(engineering leaders, the more critical metric is the Total Cost of Ownership \(TCO\).) Tj T*
(To understand the true cost of AI-assisted development, we must look at how different) Tj T*
(workflows shift the financial and operational burdens between Capital Expenditure \(CapEx\)--) Tj T*
(the upfront investment to build something--and Operational Expenditure \(OpEx\)--the) Tj T*
(ongoing cost to run, fix, and maintain it. Crucially, in the AI era, OpEx is heavily dictated by) Tj T*
(the token economy.) Tj T*
ET
