(Effective context engineering ensures the model receives a dense, high-signal payload \(such) Tj T*
(as a precise AGENTS.md file and architectural guardrails\) rather than a sprawling, noisy one.) Tj T*
(By providing the right context upfront, developers dramatically increase the agent's first-) Tj T*
(pass success rate, avoiding the costly trial-and-error loops that plague vibe coding.) Tj T*
(Scaling Efficiency via Dynamic Context and Skills) Tj T*
(To truly optimize OpEx, advanced agentic engineering relies on dynamic context through) Tj T*
(the use of "skills" or tool calling \(such as Model Context Protocol servers\) which we cover in) Tj T*
(detail in day-3 paper.) Tj T*
(Intelligent Model Routing) Tj T*
(Furthermore, agentic engineering allows for intelligent model routing. In a vibe coding) Tj T*
(workflow, a developer typically relies on a single, massive frontier model for every) Tj T*
(interaction--paying premium token prices just to ask the AI to fix a typo or generate a basic) Tj T*
(unit test.) Tj T*
(A well-designed factory model avoids this waste. It uses large, advanced models for highly) Tj T*
(complex tasks \(Requirements, Architecture, and initial Implementation\) but automatically) Tj T*
(routes deterministic, lower-complexity tasks \(Test Generation, Code Review, and CI/CD) Tj T*
(monitoring\) to smaller, faster, and significantly cheaper models. By orchestrating a multi-) Tj T*
(model ecosystem, engineering teams can maintain peak output quality while systematically) Tj T*
(driving down the operational token cost.) Tj T*
ET
