(growing as an engineer.) Tj T*
(For engineering leaders) Tj T*
(1. Make context engineering a first-class engineering practice on the team. Treat) Tj T*
(AGENTS.md, system prompts, eval suites, and skill libraries as code: reviewed in pull) Tj T*
(requests, versioned with the project, owned by named engineers. Without this discipline,) Tj T*
