(rubrics as a precondition for any agent shipping into a shared workflow, the same way test) Tj T*
(coverage gates a service deployment.) Tj T*
(3. Re-shape code review for AI-generated code. AI-generated code requires the) Tj T*
(same or greater scrutiny than human-written code, with extra attention to hallucinated) Tj T*
(dependencies, inadequate error handling, and subtle correctness gaps that look right) Tj T*
(at a glance. Train reviewers on the failure modes of generated code, and tune review) Tj T*
(checklists accordingly.) Tj T*
ET
