(For organizations) Tj T*
(1. Treat AI-assisted development as an engineering investment, not a productivity) Tj T*
(feature. The teams seeing the largest gains pair AI tooling with eval coverage,) Tj T*
(observability, and clear architectural standards. Rolling out a coding agent without that) Tj T*
