(Page 48 of 51 - 02 - The New SDLC  With Vibe Coding) Tj T*
(The new SDLC with vibe coding) Tj T*
(May 2026) Tj T*
(48) Tj T*
(3. The human role is evolving, not diminishing. The builders who understand architecture,) Tj T*
(can define precise specifications, evaluate output critically, and design effective systems) Tj T*
(of constraints and feedback loops are more valuable than ever. The skills that matter are) Tj T*
(shifting from implementation to judgment, from writing code to designing the systems that) Tj T*
(produce code.) Tj T*
(We're at the beginning of a transformation that will reshape not just how software is built,) Tj T*
(but what kind of software is possible to build. Smaller teams will be able to tackle larger) Tj T*
(problems. Individual developers will be able to build and maintain systems that previously) Tj T*
(required entire departments. The barrier to creating software will continue to fall, opening the) Tj T*
(practice of software development to a broader population.) Tj T*
(The teams that thrive will be those that embrace AI as a powerful tool while maintaining the) Tj T*
(engineering discipline that has always been the foundation of reliable software. They'll be the) Tj T*
(ones who understand that the future of software engineering isn't about choosing between) Tj T*
(human expertise and AI capability - it's about designing systems where both contribute their) Tj T*
(unique strengths.) Tj T*
(Generation is solved. Verification, judgment, and direction are the new craft.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
